    "final_answer": "I have successfully completed the task. Here is the answer:\n\n## Hiking Trail Found: **Cherry Creek Trail**\n\n**Key Details:**\n- **Address:** 2250 15th St, Denver, CO 80202\n- **Type:** Hiking area (远足区)\n- **Rating:** 4.9 stars (11 reviews)\n- **Distance from zip code 80202:** **0.6 miles** (confirmed via Google Maps directions - 14 min walk)\n\nThe Cherry Creek Trail is well within the 2-mile radius of zip code 80202, as it's actually located within the 80202 zip code itself in downtown Denver. It's classified as a hiking area and is a popular urban trail in Denver.\n\n### How I verified:\n1. Navigated to Google Maps\n2. Searched for \"hiking trails near 80202\"\n3. Selected Cherry Creek Trail from the results\n4. Used the Directions (Routes) feature from zip code 80202 to the trail\n5. Google Maps confirmed the walking distance is 0.6 miles - well within the 2-mile requirement\n\n### Other trails that appeared within the search (5 km radius) but may be further:\n- City of Cuernavaca Park\n- Sanderson Gulch Park & Trail\n- High Line Canal Trail\n- Cherry Creek Hike/Bike Path\n- Lookout Mountain Park\n- Confluence Park\n\nHowever, Cherry Creek Trail is the most suitable answer as it's clearly a hiking trail located at 0.6 miles from 80202.",
